          onLongPress: () => playFolderRecursiveShuffled(folder.path),
          previewGlyph: '≈'),
    for (final track in controller.tracks) fileRow(track, controller, t),
    // Up row, anchored at the bottom of the reversed list.
    if (controller.currentPath != null)
